desc: Convert flat list to JSON array
category: ex
par: 24
hint1: Macros + manual structure
hint2: Substitution wraps all lines with indent+quotes+comma, then fix first/last manually
solution: :%s/.*/  "&",<CR>$xo]<Esc>ggO[<Esc>
note: Wrap each line as '  "line",'; $x removes the trailing comma on the last line;
note: o]<Esc> adds the closing bracket, ggO[<Esc> adds the opening one at the top.
--- START ---
red
green
blue
yellow
purple
--- GOAL ---
[
  "red",
  "green",
  "blue",
  "yellow",
  "purple"
]
--- END ---
